(1197443, 151037, 6349, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand this.  I think it is meant to be sarcastic or ironic.  The hands are way to clean.  So is the face for that matter.  I really like the eye being cropped off the way it is.  It is very unconventional and disconcerting.  Overall, a good image but too obviously staged. 7</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand this.  I think it is meant to be sarcastic or ironic.  The hands are way to clean.  So is the face for that matter.  I really like the eye being cropped off the way it is.  It is very unconventional and disconcerting.  Overall, a good image but too obviously staged. 7', '2005-02-28 00:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
