(1197533, 150659, 6349, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far.  The lighting is great as is the soft processing.  Everything about this is perfect.  Going in my favorites now which is rare; I usually wait to add favorites until the end of the challenges. 10</td>', 'My favorite so far.  The lighting is great as is the soft processing.  Everything about this is perfect.  Going in my favorites now which is rare; I usually wait to add favorites until the end of the challenges. 10', '2005-02-28 00:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
