(1197540, 151009, 6349, '<td valign="top">Damn!  How do you do it!?  This is fantastic.  Where do I get a hat like that?  :)</td>', 'Damn!  How do you do it!?  This is fantastic.  Where do I get a hat like that?  :)', '2005-02-28 00:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197545, 151123, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I hope to look like that when I''m older.  I love the hair.</td>', 'Great capture.  I hope to look like that when I''m older.  I love the hair.', '2005-02-28 00:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197553, 149567, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like this chess photo because it is more about the players than the game (at least to me).  Great capture of the human experience of passing time.  8</td>', 'I like this chess photo because it is more about the players than the game (at least to me).  Great capture of the human experience of passing time.  8', '2005-02-28 00:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197556, 150482, 6349, '<td valign="top">Whenever I try to do things like this they come out horrible.  I admire the time I know this must have taken you.  Excellent work.</td>', 'Whenever I try to do things like this they come out horrible.  I admire the time I know this must have taken you.  Excellent work.', '2005-02-28 00:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197562, 150523, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait.  I imagine he is looking at a hawk soaring in the sky through the trees.  I appreciate this because it truly conveys a way I myself pass a lot of time.  9</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait.  I imagine he is looking at a hawk soaring in the sky through the trees.  I appreciate this because it truly conveys a way I myself pass a lot of time.  9', '2005-02-28 00:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197564, 151098, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I love the guy in the hat.  :)</td>', 'This is great.  I love the guy in the hat.  :)', '2005-02-28 00:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197571, 150781, 6349, '<td valign="top">What an expression!  Great colors.  The washed out background works well in this photo in my opinion.  It has a very lighthearted feeling to it and truly makes me believe that this is a good way to pass the time. 9</td>', 'What an expression!  Great colors.  The washed out background works well in this photo in my opinion.  It has a very lighthearted feeling to it and truly makes me believe that this is a good way to pass the time. 9', '2005-02-28 00:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197574, 151088, 10080, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, emotive shot! If the cropping we a bit off the left, and darkened a bit, it would be awesome! Still a 9!</td>', 'Wonderful, emotive shot! If the cropping we a bit off the left, and darkened a bit, it would be awesome! Still a 9!', '2005-02-28 00:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197575, 150991, 6349, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title and I''m not sure about the choice of selective desaturation but the photo is still very well composed and executed and great for the challenge.  8</td>', 'I don''t understand the title and I''m not sure about the choice of selective desaturation but the photo is still very well composed and executed and great for the challenge.  8', '2005-02-28 00:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1197579, 151129, 6349, '<td valign="top">hehehe.  i love to see fun spur of the moment photos like this.  I really hope this does well.  Sometimes reality and nutty angles that show the excitement are shunned for no good reason.  9</td>', 'hehehe.  i love to see fun spur of the moment photos like this.  I really hope this does well.  Sometimes reality and nutty angles that show the excitement are shunned for no good reason.  9', '2005-02-28 00:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
