(1199472, 151077, 8860, '<td valign="top">Love the treatment (though there is a blue cast top right) and your lens is interesting. Will come back later &amp; comment further...</td>', 'Love the treatment (though there is a blue cast top right) and your lens is interesting. Will come back later & comment further...', '2005-02-28 17:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199478, 150475, 2022, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, I like the colors and the composition, very suitable for this challenge. (10)</td>', 'Very nice picture, I like the colors and the composition, very suitable for this challenge. (10)', '2005-02-28 17:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199492, 150637, 2022, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, I wish it was cropped just a bit tighter at the bottom. Anyhow and really good picture (8)</td>', 'This is a nice photo, I wish it was cropped just a bit tighter at the bottom. Anyhow and really good picture (8)', '2005-02-28 17:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199493, 151042, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love the colours here, However for me there is just a little too much sharpening here resulting in the halo effect,</td>', 'I love the colours here, However for me there is just a little too much sharpening here resulting in the halo effect,', '2005-02-28 17:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199501, 149816, 2022, '<td valign="top">This picture seems to be too cluttered, a bit out of focus. Good try though (4)</td>', 'This picture seems to be too cluttered, a bit out of focus. Good try though (4)', '2005-02-28 17:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199503, 151123, 24212, '<td valign="top">A good candid.</td>', 'A good candid.', '2005-02-28 17:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199504, 150729, 24212, '<td valign="top">A great picture that could really be a little sharper.</td>', 'A great picture that could really be a little sharper.', '2005-02-28 17:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199506, 150958, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that the foreground, though dark for dramatic purposes, is just a bit too dark.</td>', 'I feel that the foreground, though dark for dramatic purposes, is just a bit too dark.', '2005-02-28 17:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199508, 151009, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the effect here and I love the logo on the hat, too.</td>', 'I really like the effect here and I love the logo on the hat, too.', '2005-02-28 17:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199509, 150633, 24212, '<td valign="top">This really conveys a sense of boredom.</td>', 'This really conveys a sense of boredom.', '2005-02-28 17:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199510, 150130, 24212, '<td valign="top">What lovely colours, sharpness, composition, depth of field.</td>', 'What lovely colours, sharpness, composition, depth of field.', '2005-02-28 17:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199514, 150242, 24212, '<td valign="top">I see Cyndi Lauper. That would be ''Time after Time''?<br/> <br/>The feathers look a little soft to me (in the non-sharpness sense, of course)</td>', 'I see Cyndi Lauper. That would be ''Time after Time''? The feathers look a little soft to me (in the non-sharpness sense, of course)', '2005-02-28 17:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199518, 151098, 24212, '<td valign="top">In a photo like this, I''d like to see it all sharply focussed. The carton in the foreground I find a little distracting.</td>', 'In a photo like this, I''d like to see it all sharply focussed. The carton in the foreground I find a little distracting.', '2005-02-28 17:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199522, 149211, 24212, '<td valign="top">I feel that the speckled background takes away some of the impact that the pieces could have had had they been placed on a plain surface. I like the splash of colour.</td>', 'I feel that the speckled background takes away some of the impact that the pieces could have had had they been placed on a plain surface. I like the splash of colour.', '2005-02-28 17:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199523, 151011, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, the person nearest the camera doesn''t look as sharp as the other two, which is a little disappointing.</td>', 'To me, the person nearest the camera doesn''t look as sharp as the other two, which is a little disappointing.', '2005-02-28 17:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199524, 150498, 24212, '<td valign="top">A lovely picture. I think, however, that a little selective sharpening around the face would work wonders.</td>', 'A lovely picture. I think, however, that a little selective sharpening around the face would work wonders.', '2005-02-28 17:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199528, 150538, 24212, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition here, but I feel that the overall image is let down a bit by a slight lack of sharpness.</td>', 'I really like the composition here, but I feel that the overall image is let down a bit by a slight lack of sharpness.', '2005-02-28 17:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199531, 150664, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the lighting, but would prefer to see the king and queen a little more blurred.</td>', 'I like the composition and the lighting, but would prefer to see the king and queen a little more blurred.', '2005-02-28 17:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199537, 149849, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, it''s just that the colours, especially the greens, seem a little on the subdued side.</td>', 'I like the idea, it''s just that the colours, especially the greens, seem a little on the subdued side.', '2005-02-28 17:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199538, 150661, 24212, '<td valign="top">Very funny.</td>', 'Very funny.', '2005-02-28 17:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199544, 149430, 24212, '<td valign="top">This is an image that needs to be studied to get the best out of. The more I look at it, the more I can make out. There appears to be just enough of the photographer silhouetted to be able to make out.</td>', 'This is an image that needs to be studied to get the best out of. The more I look at it, the more I can make out. There appears to be just enough of the photographer silhouetted to be able to make out.', '2005-02-28 18:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199549, 150149, 24212, '<td valign="top">Well done for capturing the face so well and not seriously overexposing the torch or the book.</td>', 'Well done for capturing the face so well and not seriously overexposing the torch or the book.', '2005-02-28 18:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199557, 150817, 24212, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective. Great monotone image. The burning around the outside really sets the mood. Great, absorbed expression. Great lighting. The more I type, the more I like it.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective. Great monotone image. The burning around the outside really sets the mood. Great, absorbed expression. Great lighting. The more I type, the more I like it.', '2005-02-28 18:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199566, 151071, 24212, '<td valign="top">I guess that there''s intended to be a dreamy look to this, but I wish it were either a bit ''dreamier'' or a lot sharper.</td>', 'I guess that there''s intended to be a dreamy look to this, but I wish it were either a bit ''dreamier'' or a lot sharper.', '2005-02-28 18:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199571, 150742, 24212, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Simple with strong lines. Excellent lighting.</td>', 'Great shot. Simple with strong lines. Excellent lighting.', '2005-02-28 18:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199573, 151066, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the shot is extremely sharp, I just feel that the lighting is a bit harsh.</td>', 'I like the composition and the shot is extremely sharp, I just feel that the lighting is a bit harsh.', '2005-02-28 18:07:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1199577, 150442, 24212, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I feel that the patch of brown (wood?) to the right of the reader and the patch of light on the page of the book are a little incongruous.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I feel that the patch of brown (wood?) to the right of the reader and the patch of light on the page of the book are a little incongruous.', '2005-02-28 18:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199580, 150282, 27789, '<td valign="top">great photo, i like how soft the mountains and sky are, and that there''s no one on the bench, it helps draw me into the photograph.  i''m not sure about the wood in the water, but it does add some interest, i''m just not sure if it''s too distracting.</td>', 'great photo, i like how soft the mountains and sky are, and that there''s no one on the bench, it helps draw me into the photograph.  i''m not sure about the wood in the water, but it does add some interest, i''m just not sure if it''s too distracting.', '2005-02-28 18:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199581, 150282, 24212, '<td valign="top">Just a beautiful picture. I love the colours and the depth of field.</td>', 'Just a beautiful picture. I love the colours and the depth of field.', '2005-02-28 18:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199582, 150783, 24212, '<td valign="top">A great candid shot.</td>', 'A great candid shot.', '2005-02-28 18:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199585, 150817, 27789, '<td valign="top">i love this photo, there''s just so much detail for my eye to explore, without being too busy.  very creative.</td>', 'i love this photo, there''s just so much detail for my eye to explore, without being too busy.  very creative.', '2005-02-28 18:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199588, 149504, 24212, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the lighting, although I feel that it could be a touch sharper.</td>', 'I love the idea and the lighting, although I feel that it could be a touch sharper.', '2005-02-28 18:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199597, 151097, 27789, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites, that''s a great tree.</td>', 'one of my favorites, that''s a great tree.', '2005-02-28 18:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199598, 150503, 24212, '<td valign="top">To me, this is like one of those optical illusions. I had trouble at first telling whether the carvings were concave or convex. I love the colour treatment.</td>', 'To me, this is like one of those optical illusions. I had trouble at first telling whether the carvings were concave or convex. I love the colour treatment.', '2005-02-28 18:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199599, 150659, 24212, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones in a wonderfully subdued image.</td>', 'Lovely tones in a wonderfully subdued image.', '2005-02-28 18:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199602, 149840, 27789, '<td valign="top">great photo, nice framing, within the photo, i''m not sure it needs the frame outside, but then i''m not a big fan of frames</td>', 'great photo, nice framing, within the photo, i''m not sure it needs the frame outside, but then i''m not a big fan of frames', '2005-02-28 18:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199610, 151077, 27789, '<td valign="top">great photo, fisheye really adds interest and an unusual perspective.  it''s got almost a 1940s technicolor feel to it, how did you do that?</td>', 'great photo, fisheye really adds interest and an unusual perspective.  it''s got almost a 1940s technicolor feel to it, how did you do that?', '2005-02-28 18:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199613, 150242, 15811, '<td valign="top">Well, I think you have a nice idea going on here and a good theme, but the image just came out much too cluttered to really have that ''punch'' if you know what I mean.  The watch and the feathers cover a large portion of that object -- it''s hard to tell what exactly it is (a tape, a large CD case, and eight-track [before my time]).<br/> <br/>In summary, less clutter and I think the image would be stronger.</td>', 'Well, I think you have a nice idea going on here and a good theme, but the image just came out much too cluttered to really have that ''punch'' if you know what I mean.  The watch and the feathers cover a large portion of that object -- it''s hard to tell what exactly it is (a tape, a large CD case, and eight-track [before my time]). In summary, less clutter and I think the image would be stronger.', '2005-02-28 18:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199620, 150468, 15811, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  The expression on the girl''s face furthest from the camera is really good.  The only reason I know they''re waiting for a train is because you told me -- otherwise, I just see a cluttered background and foreground...but I suppose you don''t have much to work with when doing candids.  A lower DOF might bring more attention to the two or possibly bring more into the frame.<br/> <br/>Either way, I like the image...it''s strong.</td>', 'Interesting.  The expression on the girl''s face furthest from the camera is really good.  The only reason I know they''re waiting for a train is because you told me -- otherwise, I just see a cluttered background and foreground...but I suppose you don''t have much to work with when doing candids.  A lower DOF might bring more attention to the two or possibly bring more into the frame. Either way, I like the image...it''s strong.', '2005-02-28 18:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199625, 150760, 15811, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field, but I think the focus may be a bit off (or camera shake).  It''s a good photo and a good idea, but the lack of sharpness really hurts it.  Good idea though!</td>', 'Good depth of field, but I think the focus may be a bit off (or camera shake).  It''s a good photo and a good idea, but the lack of sharpness really hurts it.  Good idea though!', '2005-02-28 18:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199626, 150519, 27789, '<td valign="top">this photo just doesn''t work for me. the racket touching his face in the photo is distracting, and it''s completely static, almost like a mannequin.  a more dynamic angle might have given it more movement and energy, or capturing the model in the middle of a serve or volley.</td>', 'this photo just doesn''t work for me. the racket touching his face in the photo is distracting, and it''s completely static, almost like a mannequin.  a more dynamic angle might have given it more movement and energy, or capturing the model in the middle of a serve or volley.', '2005-02-28 18:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199629, 150866, 15811, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been good at crosswords (I always do them in the TV GUIDE but I wait until the next copy is out so I can cheat before I begin).<br/> <br/>Very good idea...I''m sure a lot of people do crosswords to pass the time.  The image seems dark overall, which might be the mood you are trying to convey (if that is the case then it''s fine)...personally, I think a little more lighting could have done your entry justice, but that''s just me and I''m not marking you down any for it.<br/> <br/>good idea.</td>', 'I''ve never been good at crosswords (I always do them in the TV GUIDE but I wait until the next copy is out so I can cheat before I begin). Very good idea...I''m sure a lot of people do crosswords to pass the time.  The image seems dark overall, which might be the mood you are trying to convey (if that is the case then it''s fine)...personally, I think a little more lighting could have done your entry justice, but that''s just me and I''m not marking you down any for it. good idea.', '2005-02-28 18:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199635, 150869, 15811, '<td valign="top">hehe...that''s good.  I think your white balance is a bit off though as the sheets appear yellow...and there are a few blown areas in there as well.</td>', 'hehe...that''s good.  I think your white balance is a bit off though as the sheets appear yellow...and there are a few blown areas in there as well.', '2005-02-28 18:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199636, 150595, 15811, '<td valign="top">Great idea -- and really good depth of field.  You caught enough of the scene to really see what''s going on...very interesting!</td>', 'Great idea -- and really good depth of field.  You caught enough of the scene to really see what''s going on...very interesting!', '2005-02-28 18:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199643, 150270, 27789, '<td valign="top">i like your composition, but the lighting is really flat and uninteresting.  the top half of the frame is black and the bottom is all one value.  if you''re going for a night-time feel, a hard source, like moonlight coming through the window, perhaps a little blue, would suggest nighttime, if it''s a daytime nap, a soft source like the one you have, but coming more from above, would be more flattering.  but i''m no lighting genius, you''d be best off looking at pictures or even paying attention to lighting in movies and on television, how they communicate time of day, create a certain mood, etc.</td>', 'i like your composition, but the lighting is really flat and uninteresting.  the top half of the frame is black and the bottom is all one value.  if you''re going for a night-time feel, a hard source, like moonlight coming through the window, perhaps a little blue, would suggest nighttime, if it''s a daytime nap, a soft source like the one you have, but coming more from above, would be more flattering.  but i''m no lighting genius, you''d be best off looking at pictures or even paying attention to lighting in movies and on television, how they communicate time of day, create a certain mood, etc.', '2005-02-28 18:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199659, 151087, 27789, '<td valign="top">a deeper depth of field might have made the photo more appealing, as it is my eye immediately travels to the pencil, but then has nowhere else to look, so the photograph didn''t keep my attention</td>', 'a deeper depth of field might have made the photo more appealing, as it is my eye immediately travels to the pencil, but then has nowhere else to look, so the photograph didn''t keep my attention', '2005-02-28 18:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199694, 150827, 33947, '<td valign="top">GREAT photo for capturing the essence of the challenge theme. Very nice cropping. Love the glass block wall and that you captured three segments of it. Nicely lit.</td>', 'GREAT photo for capturing the essence of the challenge theme. Very nice cropping. Love the glass block wall and that you captured three segments of it. Nicely lit.', '2005-02-28 18:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199697, 150695, 34039, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. It is my fave in the whole challenge.  It evokes extreme emotion.  She is passing the time thinking of the past, of how much time has passed, and perhaps of all the people who have passed.   I had to call my grandma after I saw this just to talk to her for a while.</td>', 'I love this photo. It is my fave in the whole challenge.  It evokes extreme emotion.  She is passing the time thinking of the past, of how much time has passed, and perhaps of all the people who have passed.   I had to call my grandma after I saw this just to talk to her for a while.', '2005-02-28 18:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199735, 150739, 33652, '<td valign="top">The light on the snow really makes this photo great!</td>', 'The light on the snow really makes this photo great!', '2005-02-28 19:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199743, 151009, 33652, '<td valign="top">Like the "pencil drawn" effect!</td>', 'Like the "pencil drawn" effect!', '2005-02-28 19:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199747, 150325, 33652, '<td valign="top">Like the combination of soft and hard textures and DOF</td>', 'Like the combination of soft and hard textures and DOF', '2005-02-28 19:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199752, 150519, 33652, '<td valign="top">Good shot. <br/>Suggestion - Could do with a little room to the left (the space where the swing will appear)</td>', 'Good shot. Suggestion - Could do with a little room to the left (the space where the swing will appear)', '2005-02-28 19:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199757, 151013, 33652, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection and smokey bar feeling.</td>', 'I like the reflection and smokey bar feeling.', '2005-02-28 19:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199765, 151077, 33652, '<td valign="top">nteresting perspective!</td>', 'nteresting perspective!', '2005-02-28 19:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199768, 149616, 33652, '<td valign="top">Love it! Don''t know if it fits the challenge exactly. Worth 10 anyway!!</td>', 'Love it! Don''t know if it fits the challenge exactly. Worth 10 anyway!!', '2005-02-28 19:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199769, 149840, 33652, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear the music! Excellent!</td>', 'I can almost hear the music! Excellent!', '2005-02-28 19:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199773, 150933, 33652, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of light</td>', 'Beautiful use of light', '2005-02-28 19:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199780, 151022, 33652, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The houndstooth coat pattern and BW work v well.<br/> Would be a tiny bit better with the left hand fully in shot.</td>', 'Great shot. The houndstooth coat pattern and BW work v well. Would be a tiny bit better with the left hand fully in shot.', '2005-02-28 19:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199800, 150943, 33652, '<td valign="top">WOW. The textures are amazing on this photo. <br/>WOW!!!</td>', 'WOW. The textures are amazing on this photo. WOW!!!', '2005-02-28 19:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199830, 150929, 31738, '<td valign="top">This picture would of looked much better in color.</td>', 'This picture would of looked much better in color.', '2005-02-28 19:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199838, 149827, 33652, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2005-02-28 19:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199863, 150766, 31738, '<td valign="top">Beautful, too bad it''s not the real thing.</td>', 'Beautful, too bad it''s not the real thing.', '2005-02-28 19:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199864, 151125, 33652, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. <br/>I would include the whole bike shadow to improve it a touch.</td>', 'Interesting photo. I would include the whole bike shadow to improve it a touch.', '2005-02-28 19:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199892, 150679, 33652, '<td valign="top">Great colour in this shot.</td>', 'Great colour in this shot.', '2005-02-28 19:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1199896, 151009, 31738, '<td valign="top">Great idea. No one would of thought of this one. Good luck!</td>', 'Great idea. No one would of thought of this one. Good luck!', '2005-02-28 19:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1200001, 150548, 33687, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and toning! Wonderful job.</td>', 'I love the lighting and toning! Wonderful job.', '2005-02-28 20:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1200023, 150604, 33736, '<td valign="top">Wow. Double Wow.  When I grow up, can I take pictures like these?</td>', 'Wow. Double Wow.  When I grow up, can I take pictures like these?', '2005-02-28 21:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1200062, 150523, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really nice image, but a little too posed looking for my tastes.  It looks very much like the style of high school senior pictures nowadays.  6</td>', 'I think this is a really nice image, but a little too posed looking for my tastes.  It looks very much like the style of high school senior pictures nowadays.  6', '2005-02-28 21:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1200063, 150961, 31606, '<td valign="top">One of my top three.  Nice colors.  I like it. 10</td>', 'One of my top three.  Nice colors.  I like it. 10', '2005-02-28 21:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1200064, 151009, 31606, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh.  I like it.  What an orginal idea. 10.  One of my top three.  Nice hat by the way.</td>', 'Made me laugh.  I like it.  What an orginal idea. 10.  One of my top three.  Nice hat by the way.', '2005-02-28 21:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1200066, 150282, 31606, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  One of my top three.  I like the way the sun hits the mountains in the background. 10</td>', 'Beautiful.  One of my top three.  I like the way the sun hits the mountains in the background. 10', '2005-02-28 21:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1200067, 149430, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous image.  The only thing I would have changed would to have either cloned out the light, or toned it down.  As it is, it is so much brighter than the rest of the image that my eyes can''t help but to go there.    Still, I really like this!  9</td>', 'This is a fabulous image.  The only thing I would have changed would to have either cloned out the light, or toned it down.  As it is, it is so much brighter than the rest of the image that my eyes can''t help but to go there.    Still, I really like this!  9', '2005-02-28 21:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1200068, 150482, 31606, '<td valign="top">I would love to know how you done this.  The only thing I don''t like is the border.  I think it would have done better without it. 8</td>', 'I would love to know how you done this.  The only thing I don''t like is the border.  I think it would have done better without it. 8', '2005-02-28 21:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1200070, 150942, 31214, '<td valign="top">Great shot....I would recommend cropping the curtain off the left, as that would make your subject a little more left of center too.  Nice job.</td>', 'Great shot....I would recommend cropping the curtain off the left, as that would make your subject a little more left of center too.  Nice job.', '2005-02-28 21:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1200073, 150908, 18799, '<td valign="top">No doubt that this is a time passing activity for kids.  I think the composition is a little uninteresting.  Maybe closer, or moving her off-center would help.</td>', 'No doubt that this is a time passing activity for kids.  I think the composition is a little uninteresting.  Maybe closer, or moving her off-center would help.', '2005-02-28 21:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1200074, 150766, 15811, '<td valign="top">oh wow.  I thought my entry was good...then this came along...SUPERB colors and dynamic range here!  I can''t wait to see who and what camera took this one. <br/> <br/>I''m not too sure exactly what that glowing is around the rooftops, but I don''t care -- absolutely beautiful image here!</td>', 'oh wow.  I thought my entry was good...then this came along...SUPERB colors and dynamic range here!  I can''t wait to see who and what camera took this one.  I''m not too sure exactly what that glowing is around the rooftops, but I don''t care -- absolutely beautiful image here!', '2005-02-28 21:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1200076, 149302, 15811, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing prof_fate for this one for some strange reason -- although I''m probably WAYYYY off.  <br/> <br/>I like the photo a lot -- don''t know how you got the bird to sit on your hand!</td>', 'I''m guessing prof_fate for this one for some strange reason -- although I''m probably WAYYYY off.   I like the photo a lot -- don''t know how you got the bird to sit on your hand!', '2005-02-28 21:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
