(1200125, 150442, 33560, '<td valign="top">The strong lighting does not work for me.  I wish to see more gentle tonal gradation in the face and I would rather either be certain I see the details in the background, or simply have it be black.  My impression of this photo is that the black is not really black, and this is a shame since the photo needs the full range of values to work.</td>', 'The strong lighting does not work for me.  I wish to see more gentle tonal gradation in the face and I would rather either be certain I see the details in the background, or simply have it be black.  My impression of this photo is that the black is not really black, and this is a shame since the photo needs the full range of values to work.', '2005-02-28 22:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1200128, 150869, 18799, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if this subject would make it into the competition.  I like the image and give it an 8.  I will be interested to see how you do with this crowd.</td>', 'I was wondering if this subject would make it into the competition.  I like the image and give it an 8.  I will be interested to see how you do with this crowd.', '2005-02-28 22:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
