(1200213, 150174, 33560, '<td valign="top">Is it possible to list all the bad things about this photo?  The graininess, the out of focus, the camera motion, the unpleasant color palette, and so on.  Yet every one of these flaws seems to enhance the photo.  Why is this?    It''s a strong concept, and a strong composition.  And the flaws draw us instantly into the uncomfortable world of  insomnia.</td>', 'Is it possible to list all the bad things about this photo?  The graininess, the out of focus, the camera motion, the unpleasant color palette, and so on.  Yet every one of these flaws seems to enhance the photo.  Why is this?    It''s a strong concept, and a strong composition.  And the flaws draw us instantly into the uncomfortable world of  insomnia.', '2005-02-28 22:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
