(1201217, 150766, 31637, '<td valign="top">amazing composition. Passing time in Venice looks fun..too bad its not venice !! it''s ok...Vegas is just as fun?? is it Vegas? .look how blue the water looks? it''s like a swimming pool..did you edit it?? ...very nice (8)</td>', 'amazing composition. Passing time in Venice looks fun..too bad its not venice !! it''s ok...Vegas is just as fun?? is it Vegas? .look how blue the water looks? it''s like a swimming pool..did you edit it?? ...very nice (8)', '2005-03-01 14:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1201232, 150908, 33520, '<td valign="top">nice clear image 8</td>', 'nice clear image 8', '2005-03-01 14:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1201245, 149211, 6999, '<td valign="top">I quite like the idea, and the colour reprooduction is pretty good; but i think you need to work on your understanding of composition, especially as elements like colour affect it. The clutter and various colours and brighnesses of the jumbled pieces here really removes attention from the curve of fitted pieces, which also only enters the frame in a prettty weak and apologetic way. The graininess of your background doesn''t help the impression of the image, and the evenness of the light, whilst helping the definition of your details, has really reduced any sense of three dimensions. There is, technically, some good work here, but that flat light and the lack of any sense of depth has ruined a lot of the good work I fear.</td>', 'I quite like the idea, and the colour reprooduction is pretty good; but i think you need to work on your understanding of composition, especially as elements like colour affect it. The clutter and various colours and brighnesses of the jumbled pieces here really removes attention from the curve of fitted pieces, which also only enters the frame in a prettty weak and apologetic way. The graininess of your background doesn''t help the impression of the image, and the evenness of the light, whilst helping the definition of your details, has really reduced any sense of three dimensions. There is, technically, some good work here, but that flat light and the lack of any sense of depth has ruined a lot of the good work I fear.', '2005-03-01 15:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1201253, 150940, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like this, despite it consisting of a number of things I have little time for - perhaps rather, I should say, <i>because</i> of that: the hyper-smoothness is taken so far, the selective de-sat is so almost arbitrary, the sharpenin artefacts in the trees (and their associated wonderful effect in the image right trees. That halo-ing around the branches image left is the only thing that stops me thinking this is rather a work of acccident than genius. I shall, if i have time, have to comback to it to decide what I really think.</td>', 'I like this, despite it consisting of a number of things I have little time for - perhaps rather, I should say, because of that: the hyper-smoothness is taken so far, the selective de-sat is so almost arbitrary, the sharpenin artefacts in the trees (and their associated wonderful effect in the image right trees. That halo-ing around the branches image left is the only thing that stops me thinking this is rather a work of acccident than genius. I shall, if i have time, have to comback to it to decide what I really think.', '2005-03-01 15:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
