(1203207, 150242, 18738, '<td valign="top">I just found this way too busy. The watch I understand and there''s some tape. I assume the tape has a song on it that means something but it''s not very clear. And the feathers...oh the feathers why are they there?<br/> <br/>OTOH this is my first comment for this challenge so perhaps there is something interesting about this photo.</td>', 'I just found this way too busy. The watch I understand and there''s some tape. I assume the tape has a song on it that means something but it''s not very clear. And the feathers...oh the feathers why are they there? OTOH this is my first comment for this challenge so perhaps there is something interesting about this photo.', '2005-03-02 12:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203213, 151050, 18738, '<td valign="top">You might be slaughtered by the votes for being dingy, out of focus and noisy or you may not. I don''t like to try and predict. However, this is stunning and I especially like the way the thumbs disapear against the bacground. Definitely one of the best from this challenge.</td>', 'You might be slaughtered by the votes for being dingy, out of focus and noisy or you may not. I don''t like to try and predict. However, this is stunning and I especially like the way the thumbs disapear against the bacground. Definitely one of the best from this challenge.', '2005-03-02 12:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203220, 151054, 18738, '<td valign="top"><br/></td>', '', '2005-03-02 12:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203504, 150680, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like the perspective, but at the same time, the line of horizon and the lines in the boardwalk are tricky because they''re not straight with respect to the image boundaries. The colors are great.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like the perspective, but at the same time, the line of horizon and the lines in the boardwalk are tricky because they''re not straight with respect to the image boundaries. The colors are great.', '2005-03-02 14:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203513, 150601, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think the red color and the light/shadows of the image are attractive. Would''ve liked to have seen a real person for the challenge''s sake, though.</td>', 'I think the red color and the light/shadows of the image are attractive. Would''ve liked to have seen a real person for the challenge''s sake, though.', '2005-03-02 14:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203519, 150282, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful - almost 3D. The mountains, blue sky, and bench almost jump out of the screen. I just wrote in another comment that I''d like to see a real person in their entry, but in yours, it''s so easy to imagine a real person sitting on that bench that I''m can''t rightfully take anything away from the score for not having a person. (I learned something about the way I look at these images just now - cool!)</td>', 'This is beautiful - almost 3D. The mountains, blue sky, and bench almost jump out of the screen. I just wrote in another comment that I''d like to see a real person in their entry, but in yours, it''s so easy to imagine a real person sitting on that bench that I''m can''t rightfully take anything away from the score for not having a person. (I learned something about the way I look at these images just now - cool!)', '2005-03-02 14:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203523, 149878, 31133, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The blur in the foreground frames the subject nicely - the brown background is also great with the hands and the blue yarn.</td>', 'Very nice. The blur in the foreground frames the subject nicely - the brown background is also great with the hands and the blue yarn.', '2005-03-02 14:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203531, 151041, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love, love, love pictures of old hands, especially when they are doing something like here in your entry. I really wish that levels or something were applied (it''s advanced editing, so I think that''s okay) to make her hands not so washed out. For example, there''s a reflection on the pinky finger that I think could be taken away with a dose of levels. I think the composition is good and you''ve definitely met the challenge.</td>', 'I love, love, love pictures of old hands, especially when they are doing something like here in your entry. I really wish that levels or something were applied (it''s advanced editing, so I think that''s okay) to make her hands not so washed out. For example, there''s a reflection on the pinky finger that I think could be taken away with a dose of levels. I think the composition is good and you''ve definitely met the challenge.', '2005-03-02 14:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203536, 151059, 31133, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this a 9 - if the wrist could''ve been as still-looking as the guitar, it would be a 10 from me. I love how the thumb looks against the perfectly still guitar. (is it a guitar - hope I''m not naming the wrong instrument!)</td>', 'I''m giving this a 9 - if the wrist could''ve been as still-looking as the guitar, it would be a 10 from me. I love how the thumb looks against the perfectly still guitar. (is it a guitar - hope I''m not naming the wrong instrument!)', '2005-03-02 14:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203652, 150475, 4517, '<td valign="top">This is a cracking photo and so sharp. I can see why you wanted to enter it in a challenge but not really suited to passing time. Then again people go to zoos to pass the time. What the heck 10 to you. In my favorites.</td>', 'This is a cracking photo and so sharp. I can see why you wanted to enter it in a challenge but not really suited to passing time. Then again people go to zoos to pass the time. What the heck 10 to you. In my favorites.', '2005-03-02 15:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203655, 150679, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great colours.</td>', 'Great colours.', '2005-03-02 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203656, 150507, 4517, '<td valign="top">Thats a great thing to do to pass the time. Bonus points to you :)</td>', 'Thats a great thing to do to pass the time. Bonus points to you :)', '2005-03-02 15:44:15.000000', NULL, 1);
