(1206028, 150654, 31133, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot - I like the depth and then the concentrated focus on the one piece. Lighting is also good. I made the following comment in a couple other comments, and hope you don''t mind - but I do with there was a hand or something in your entry to show a person doing something to pass the time.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot - I like the depth and then the concentrated focus on the one piece. Lighting is also good. I made the following comment in a couple other comments, and hope you don''t mind - but I do with there was a hand or something in your entry to show a person doing something to pass the time.', '2005-03-03 17:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
