(1206375, 150659, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this photograph.  Its deceptively casual character makes it easy to overlook the meticulous composition and expert execution that went into creating it.  Which just goes to show how very good it is; this photographer is skilful enough that it isn''t necessary to show off by getting in the way of the image.  Mastery &amp; maturity.  10</td>', 'I like everything about this photograph.  Its deceptively casual character makes it easy to overlook the meticulous composition and expert execution that went into creating it.  Which just goes to show how very good it is; this photographer is skilful enough that it isn''t necessary to show off by getting in the way of the image.  Mastery & maturity.  10', '2005-03-03 19:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1206379, 150729, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition &amp; light, plus the inclusion of just enough background for context, elevates a simple scene to serious art.  9</td>', 'Terrific composition & light, plus the inclusion of just enough background for context, elevates a simple scene to serious art.  9', '2005-03-03 19:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
