(1207010, 150795, 7151, '<td valign="top">To who???  (I''m sure you''ll get 34 versions of that line.)</td>', 'To who???  (I''m sure you''ll get 34 versions of that line.)', '2005-03-04 01:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207076, 150442, 30364, '<td valign="top">This appeals to me; the simple composition, the dramatic splash of sunlight (which reminds me of a 19th century Dutch painting), the beautiful pewter-like glow of the book, and the barely discernible background details.  There''s nothing spectacular about it, and yet the overall effect is harmonious and pleasing.  8</td>', 'This appeals to me; the simple composition, the dramatic splash of sunlight (which reminds me of a 19th century Dutch painting), the beautiful pewter-like glow of the book, and the barely discernible background details.  There''s nothing spectacular about it, and yet the overall effect is harmonious and pleasing.  8', '2005-03-04 03:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207080, 150908, 30364, '<td valign="top">What is that structure?  It appears to be a bullet-scarred rubbish bin for discarded school children,  but that can''t be right.  It''s a very strange photograph; interesting in a pointless kind of way.  I probably don''t get it, but at least it captured my attention.  6.</td>', 'What is that structure?  It appears to be a bullet-scarred rubbish bin for discarded school children,  but that can''t be right.  It''s a very strange photograph; interesting in a pointless kind of way.  I probably don''t get it, but at least it captured my attention.  6.', '2005-03-04 03:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207084, 150955, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is very effective &amp; moving; a quiet despair, well captured and presented in this spare composition.  7</td>', 'This is very effective & moving; a quiet despair, well captured and presented in this spare composition.  7', '2005-03-04 03:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207089, 150633, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yep, I recognise that MEGO expression.  And the worst part is, "shopping" gets no more bearable with time; 25 years from now he''ll still be considering diving over that parapet.<br/>It''s a striking composition; the lighting and the structural forms amplify the young man''s attitude of mind-numbing despair.  7</td>', 'Yep, I recognise that MEGO expression.  And the worst part is, "shopping" gets no more bearable with time; 25 years from now he''ll still be considering diving over that parapet.It''s a striking composition; the lighting and the structural forms amplify the young man''s attitude of mind-numbing despair.  7', '2005-03-04 03:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207092, 150869, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very bold, and very, very good as well.  Hovers brilliantly just on the "respectable" margin of erotic art, and is all the more erotic for that finely judged positioning.  Pity you had to bludgeon us with the self-evident title, but I guess you have to cater for the imaginatively disadvantaged among us.  Conceptually outstanding and masterfully executed.  9 <br/>Second look:  I can''t give it 9; it has no flaws at all .... so it''s got to be a 10</td>', 'Very bold, and very, very good as well.  Hovers brilliantly just on the "respectable" margin of erotic art, and is all the more erotic for that finely judged positioning.  Pity you had to bludgeon us with the self-evident title, but I guess you have to cater for the imaginatively disadvantaged among us.  Conceptually outstanding and masterfully executed.  9 Second look:  I can''t give it 9; it has no flaws at all .... so it''s got to be a 10', '2005-03-04 03:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207157, 150958, 34547, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit dark, but I love the texture on the pavement and the planar feeling from the clouds.</td>', 'It''s a bit dark, but I love the texture on the pavement and the planar feeling from the clouds.', '2005-03-04 05:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
