(1209102, 150515, 9073, '<td valign="top">Try cropping off the top 1/4. Otherwise, a very fine photograph: lovely colours, rich reflections on the loch and a very vibrant sence of the passion of fishing.</td>', 'Try cropping off the top 1/4. Otherwise, a very fine photograph: lovely colours, rich reflections on the loch and a very vibrant sence of the passion of fishing.', '2005-03-05 08:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1209104, 150942, 9073, '<td valign="top">The skin textures on the hand are very powerful. The duotoning was a good choice to emphasise the age of the subject. I also like the pose. What surprises me is that I like the negative space on the right. Its emptiness really supports the meaning here.</td>', 'The skin textures on the hand are very powerful. The duotoning was a good choice to emphasise the age of the subject. I also like the pose. What surprises me is that I like the negative space on the right. Its emptiness really supports the meaning here.', '2005-03-05 08:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1209106, 149280, 9073, '<td valign="top">There''s a strong sense of line from top left along the arm to the middle right. And that''s exactly where the bright areas are. So, in terms of composition, this works very well. However, the subject is a bit bland and impersonal. A bit more drama would help here.</td>', 'There''s a strong sense of line from top left along the arm to the middle right. And that''s exactly where the bright areas are. So, in terms of composition, this works very well. However, the subject is a bit bland and impersonal. A bit more drama would help here.', '2005-03-05 08:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1209109, 150154, 9073, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling that this photo is a little too staged for my tastes. The implied line and deliberateness of the clock directly above the head and having its big hand point directly upwards mirrors the line in the lamp, and this is good, but I''m not attracted to the overall feel of this photo.</td>', 'I get the feeling that this photo is a little too staged for my tastes. The implied line and deliberateness of the clock directly above the head and having its big hand point directly upwards mirrors the line in the lamp, and this is good, but I''m not attracted to the overall feel of this photo.', '2005-03-05 08:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1209112, 150548, 9073, '<td valign="top">The blue hues are appropriate for the old-time feel of this microphone, and the off-centred composition stops it from being boring. However, the blue ironically leaves me a bit cold.</td>', 'The blue hues are appropriate for the old-time feel of this microphone, and the off-centred composition stops it from being boring. However, the blue ironically leaves me a bit cold.', '2005-03-05 08:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1209118, 149397, 9073, '<td valign="top">Very clear. Good strong line and sense of action.</td>', 'Very clear. Good strong line and sense of action.', '2005-03-05 08:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
