(1211869, 150869, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is the first time I''ve come back to an image, just to read the comments left for the work.  Wow, they are all over the place.  I think some people really need to have their eyes examined.  One guy said he couldn''t even tell if it was a man or a woman without the title.  And some folks need to have their monitors checked before they start handing out critiques about lighting.  I''ve looked at this on three differnt monitors and I think the lighting is fine.  Softer lighting or less harsh shadows might be fine, but they would also change the mood.  Some people just "don''t get it".  And this is clearly a very conservative crowd judging our images.  When I opened the challege to see the results this morning, I expected to see this at #1.  You should pat yourself on the back for a very well done image.  I hope you find a place in the bedroom to hang this print.  I''m sure many print shops would love to be selling it.  My girlfriend loved the shot so much, she wished it had been our idea.  Congrats once again on an outstanding image.</td>', 'This is the first time I''ve come back to an image, just to read the comments left for the work.  Wow, they are all over the place.  I think some people really need to have their eyes examined.  One guy said he couldn''t even tell if it was a man or a woman without the title.  And some folks need to have their monitors checked before they start handing out critiques about lighting.  I''ve looked at this on three differnt monitors and I think the lighting is fine.  Softer lighting or less harsh shadows might be fine, but they would also change the mood.  Some people just "don''t get it".  And this is clearly a very conservative crowd judging our images.  When I opened the challege to see the results this morning, I expected to see this at #1.  You should pat yourself on the back for a very well done image.  I hope you find a place in the bedroom to hang this print.  I''m sure many print shops would love to be selling it.  My girlfriend loved the shot so much, she wished it had been our idea.  Congrats once again on an outstanding image.', '2005-03-07 05:26:09.000000', NULL, 0),
