(1211999, 149840, 33736, '<td valign="top">This is where a picture is "worth a thousand Sounds!"  Silhouetting the mellow richness of the players'' image invokes the mellow, rich sounds one imagines that they are sending out over the water.<br/> <br/>I believe this is the best submission of yours to date.  Kathy</td>', 'This is where a picture is "worth a thousand Sounds!"  Silhouetting the mellow richness of the players'' image invokes the mellow, rich sounds one imagines that they are sending out over the water. I believe this is the best submission of yours to date.  Kathy', '2005-03-07 06:50:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1212013, 149616, 15766, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the feedback. The photo is pretty much a straight shot. I cropped and desaturated. <br/> <br/>As for if it fits the challenge, the ideas is that the ship is anchored due to the fog. So the implication is that the ship''s crew is "passing time" waiting for the fog to lift.<br/> <br/>The shot was at the Bonnet Carrie Spillway in Norco, Louisiana on the Mississippi river.<br/> <br/>The bird is an egret. I tried to get a closer shot but he wasn''t happy with that and flew away. <br/> <br/>I agree that I probably should have taken the stick out but I didn''t notice it until I saw it in the comments. That is why I joined this site was for the feedback.<br/> <br/>This was my first real submission and it was very exciting. I think I''ll try it again. :-)<br/> <br/>Thanks again for taking the time to critique this photo and for all the positive comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-07 07:03:50.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the feedback. The photo is pretty much a straight shot. I cropped and desaturated.  As for if it fits the challenge, the ideas is that the ship is anchored due to the fog. So the implication is that the ship''s crew is "passing time" waiting for the fog to lift. The shot was at the Bonnet Carrie Spillway in Norco, Louisiana on the Mississippi river. The bird is an egret. I tried to get a closer shot but he wasn''t happy with that and flew away.  I agree that I probably should have taken the stick out but I didn''t notice it until I saw it in the comments. That is why I joined this site was for the feedback. This was my first real submission and it was very exciting. I think I''ll try it again. :-) Thanks again for taking the time to critique this photo and for all the positive comments.', '2005-03-07 07:02:31.000000', '2005-03-07 07:03:50.000000', 0),
(1212040, 150656, 12611, '<td valign="top">vastly underrated. THe focus, flash on the cat adn fish are superb. If you let your eyes go a little blurry you really have nice composition. I just had to comment because I have been at the bottom before. You show good creativity and that is much better than a formulaic wonk!</td>', 'vastly underrated. THe focus, flash on the cat adn fish are superb. If you let your eyes go a little blurry you really have nice composition. I just had to comment because I have been at the bottom before. You show good creativity and that is much better than a formulaic wonk!', '2005-03-07 07:23:39.000000', NULL, 0),
