(1212083, 149816, 33515, '<td valign="top">This gets filed under "What was I thinking". For the info of all, I am not out of focus, I am moving. I used a 2 second shuttle speed and if I could stay still that long I would have made the putt the first time. A photo to learn from, thanks for all the comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-10 08:54:33.</i></td>', 'This gets filed under "What was I thinking". For the info of all, I am not out of focus, I am moving. I used a 2 second shuttle speed and if I could stay still that long I would have made the putt the first time. A photo to learn from, thanks for all the comments.', '2005-03-07 08:15:53.000000', '2005-03-10 08:54:33.000000', 0),
