(1212241, 149840, 20115, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon--isn''t great--just got my first last week.  Love this shot.</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon--isn''t great--just got my first last week.  Love this shot.', '2005-03-07 09:42:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1212265, 149430, 30018, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a very nice image and a ribbon!  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Congrats on a very nice image and a ribbon!  Keep up the good work.', '2005-03-07 09:55:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1212303, 150869, 7473, '<td valign="top">ClickNSee,<br/>   Thank you very much for your kind comments.  I was telling a friend of mine during the voting that there would probably be a nice little bell curve of conservatism to liberal.  I think I was right except for the 1s that some people gave the photo which were more than I thought.  <br/> <br/>  I wanted to push the envelope with this one just to see how the crowd here thought.  I have a Black and white version of this photo that I''m going to upload to my gallery tonight.  It is much better than this one, in my opinion  but I still really like this one.  I was in quite a rush when we did this shot as we only had an hour and a half to take the photo and run it through PS.  <br/> <br/>Thank you again,<br/>Ben</td>', 'ClickNSee,   Thank you very much for your kind comments.  I was telling a friend of mine during the voting that there would probably be a nice little bell curve of conservatism to liberal.  I think I was right except for the 1s that some people gave the photo which were more than I thought.     I wanted to push the envelope with this one just to see how the crowd here thought.  I have a Black and white version of this photo that I''m going to upload to my gallery tonight.  It is much better than this one, in my opinion  but I still really like this one.  I was in quite a rush when we did this shot as we only had an hour and a half to take the photo and run it through PS.   Thank you again,Ben', '2005-03-07 10:11:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1212314, 150679, 32754, '<td valign="top">Sorry this didn''t place higher..it was just beautiful and fun to look at!</td>', 'Sorry this didn''t place higher..it was just beautiful and fun to look at!', '2005-03-07 10:16:40.000000', NULL, 0),
