(1212818, 150869, 30018, '<td valign="top">Ben...I like the B&amp;W better.  Gives it more of a "night time" feel.  I love this shot too! Better title too!  I think the other title turned some people off.   Steve</td>', 'Ben...I like the B&W better.  Gives it more of a "night time" feel.  I love this shot too! Better title too!  I think the other title turned some people off.   Steve', '2005-03-07 13:43:07.000000', NULL, 0),
