(1214317, 150869, 30364, '<td valign="top">I still love it, not the least because of the several hilarious comments it provoked, including the following (the first two of which were obviously intentional):<br/>"wonder if this one will get pulled"<br/>"would have been better desaturated"<br/>"the sheets appear yellow"<br/>"not funny--don''t like it--in fact I hate it"</td>', 'I still love it, not the least because of the several hilarious comments it provoked, including the following (the first two of which were obviously intentional):"wonder if this one will get pulled""would have been better desaturated""the sheets appear yellow""not funny--don''t like it--in fact I hate it"', '2005-03-08 06:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
